00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:06.260
No, I'm the musician.

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:10.540
Not in your face!

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:13.380
Who is that man you spoke to first, uncle?

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:16.980
Our salvation! I got you a phenomenal contract for the radio.

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:20.990
He's a millionaire industrialist. We want to sign the contract when we get to Buenos Aires.

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:24.290
Really? Then you can send a telegram to mom that the trunk is being prepared.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:28.090
What trunk? Are you going to send money to buy the plane luggage for your old woman?

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:29.290
It's already in full fantasy.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:30.000
Maybe it's true.

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:32.510
We have to celebrate at the bar!

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.490
I'll pay for it!

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:35.490
Let's borrow a lira from Chiricó to pay my commission!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.490
Let's go!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:42.180
Come on, let's go down.

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:14.260
You told me about a big hotel.

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:16.460
Don't pay attention to the exterior.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:17.960
It's a mansion inside.

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:20.680
Here you eat very well and the lady loves me very much.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:24.310
Besides, when the triumph arrives, we'll live in a luxury hotel.

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:26.000
Come in. Come in.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.600
Come on, hurry up. Estrellita will tell you everything.

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:29.920
Come on, hurry up.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.080
Second floor, the stairs, huh?

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:35.760
That's it. Second floor, the stairs.

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.160
Now I'll send you to pay. Ten pesos, right?

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:40.850
Yes. And my luggage?

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:44.070
Here everyone takes care of their own, and there they drop me off in Bandurria.

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:48.210
Egoist. Let's see if I lose my belongings.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:02.600
It costs a mansion.

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:07.010
Keep going. There on the right, in the dining room,

00:19:07.090 --> 00:19:09.670
must be the boss. She loves me with madness, poor woman.

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:12.690
Come on, help her a little, let her carry this.

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:16.450
You saw, to get her out of the way. Help her, help her, you too.

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:18.580
Yes, yes. Come on, grab the table.

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:20.440
Do you want to take it from above?

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.160
Grab it, walk.

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.830
It's a phenomenon, as if I had to wash the entire wall here.

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:30.000
Good evening, or good afternoon.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:33.370
Mrs. Juana, don't you remember me?

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:36.700
Oh, little star, how are you?

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:38.670
Where is your uncle's shame?

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:40.770
How is the pensioner's flower?

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:42.730
The tramp has appeared.

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:45.770
Right now he's going to pay everything he owes me before going to Europe.

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:47.190
But, ma'am...

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:49.840
Is it a representative or a pharaoh?

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:51.340
I'm like you.

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:53.820
He found me two years ago and ruined me.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:56.240
There is no pension for any of you here.

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:57.820
What a joke, Mrs. Juana.

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:00.000
But if he's going to pay everything, we'll bring him here.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:02.480
Let's see, Nicola, show us the Liras, will you?

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:06.970
Nicola always has the few Liras she brought from Italy.

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:10.640
- How much is that? - 50,000 Liras.

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:14.720
50,000! Well, there's a piece for each one of you.

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:18.570
But every weekend, if you don't pay, you go to the street.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:25.730
- Come on, let's go. - When the old lady knows what the Liras are worth...

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:26.730
...she'll poison us.

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:30.000
A week ago, we would have triumphed and succeeded.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.350
We'll be rich. Let's go, valor!

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:35.600
Ma'am, send the car to pay!

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:30.000
But this is just a little bit.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.270
For the ones who pay, I'd need more than I still need for the food.

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:38.360
Look, I'm a hard worker, Mrs. Juana's soup is delicious.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:44.660
It's a cream, what a divine cook's hand you have.

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:46.500
And you, what a shameless face.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:50.020
Always the same humorist you.

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:53.540
50,000 liras, in the first week, they ran out.

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:55.260
How well you tricked me, huh?

00:21:55.300 --> 00:21:57.260
One moment, ma'am, I didn't lie to you.

00:21:57.520 --> 00:21:58.930
How many liras did you show her?

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:03.500
- Everything I had, 50,000. - And what did I know that the lira was worth 10 cents?

00:22:04.110 --> 00:22:06.840
If they don't pay tomorrow, the three weeks they owe, they all go to the street.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:10.740
I'm going to make a nice America with your uncle, Stella.

00:22:11.150 --> 00:22:14.590
In a moment or another they will hire any of your great actors and you will pay them.

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:16.690
Enough! I'm going to eat at Vagos.

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:19.110
There are other jobs besides the theater and the radio.

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:23.090
My dedicated husband earned 60 pesos for manning bags in the port.

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:27.820
I would do anything, I am a peasant's son, I would work the land, I would go to a factory.

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:30.000
But this man doesn't leave me.

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:33.200
Of course not. A great artist does not lower those thousands of dollars.

00:22:33.200 --> 00:22:37.720
Besides, Doña Juana, this is not the time to talk about money in front of the other pensioners.

00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:41.440
If it weren't for you, I would get married, because your niece and Mr. Nicola are not to blame.

00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:45.110
- You are the one with the face. - Enough. I can't stand this shame anymore.

00:22:45.110 --> 00:22:48.120
- I'm leaving right now. - Carlos, what's wrong with you?

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:54.680
Don't you see what you've done, ma'am? You ruined lunch for that poor boy.

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:59.120
- I think we too... - No, you can keep eating.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:05.800
I like it because it looks decent, and besides, it has a beautiful smile.

00:23:05.800 --> 00:23:08.280
Yes, we have it.

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:10.110
And what is the second dish, gentlemen?

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:14.110
The second dish is this one that you are going to throw in your head, near the canteen.

00:23:14.110 --> 00:23:21.110
No, with you it is not the thing, no. Keep smiling.

00:23:21.110 --> 00:23:25.110
More than smiling, smiling, I feel like crying like a dog.

00:23:25.110 --> 00:23:28.070
And I was complaining that I ate little, so.

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:30.000
What are you going to do now?

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:33.000
We broke a lot of shoes looking for work and no one wants us.

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:35.980
In reality, they reject you for your trams.

00:23:35.980 --> 00:23:37.980
I'm sorry for you, Estrella.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:40.870
But last night they told me about a tour inside with an orchestra.

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:41.870
And I prefer to go.

00:23:41.870 --> 00:23:42.870
Leaving me.

00:23:42.870 --> 00:23:43.870
Leaving us all.

00:23:43.870 --> 00:23:45.730
Forgetting about ours.

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:47.100
What do you want?

00:23:47.100 --> 00:23:50.960
Everyone has to defend himself as much as they can.

00:23:50.960 --> 00:23:51.850
It's life.

00:23:51.850 --> 00:23:53.740
That's my country. It's called villageria.

00:23:53.740 --> 00:23:55.560
I would never leave you alone, Estrella.

00:23:55.560 --> 00:23:56.560
I love you.

00:23:56.560 --> 00:23:57.560
I love you.

00:23:57.560 --> 00:23:59.000
I love you.

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:00.000
I love you.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.700
We are not here for sentimentalism, Sahor.

00:24:02.700 --> 00:24:05.530
Thank you, Nicolás, but don't worry.

00:24:05.530 --> 00:24:11.160
Carlos Acerina, young, has to fight to do something for his career.

00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:16.020
Ungrateful. After everything I've done for him, I broke everything.

00:24:16.020 --> 00:24:20.430
Let's see if you're going to behave like this when he breaks everything for you.

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:23.730
If he's going to break for me like he broke for him,

00:24:23.730 --> 00:24:25.730
it's better for him to stay whole.

00:24:25.730 --> 00:24:29.150
It's nothing, it's just that I don't want anything to happen to him.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:34.810
Captain Carlos has a job, and we must not disappoint him.

00:24:34.810 --> 00:24:37.690
Goodbye, and good luck.

00:24:37.690 --> 00:24:39.700
Goodbye.

00:24:39.700 --> 00:24:43.290
Come on, Stella, don't listen to him.

00:24:43.290 --> 00:24:46.160
May you have many successes in your tour.

00:24:46.160 --> 00:24:48.350
Oh, don't worry about my commission.

00:24:48.350 --> 00:24:49.850
Send it to me by mail.

00:24:49.850 --> 00:24:52.050
- Get out of here or I'll... - No, no, no!

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:03.140
And how do I like to come to this square with you, Stella.

00:25:03.140 --> 00:25:05.960
Do you remember two months ago when we arrived in Europe?

00:25:05.960 --> 00:25:10.890
We came every night with Carlos and... full of illusions.

00:25:10.890 --> 00:25:15.740
- Stella. - What?

00:25:15.740 --> 00:25:18.920
- Do you remember Carlos very much? - No.

00:25:18.920 --> 00:25:21.290
Like me, sometimes I think of him.

00:25:21.290 --> 00:25:24.600
I wonder how he will do in the tour. Nothing else.

00:25:24.600 --> 00:25:30.000
- If I tell you one thing, will you forgive me? - So serious.

00:25:30.800 --> 00:25:35.650
For me, yes. I'm in love. I love you, Stella.

00:25:35.650 --> 00:25:42.250
Please, Nikola, don't be humble. We're companions, of disgrace and nothing else.

00:25:42.250 --> 00:25:46.240
You're alone. I'm also in a country I don't know.

00:25:46.240 --> 00:25:51.950
I need you, Stella. And if you were my wife, I would come to the triumph to make you happy.

00:25:51.950 --> 00:25:58.230
I love you very much, Nikola, but can you imagine what our marriage life would be like in this misery?

00:25:58.230 --> 00:25:59.800
One day I will be successful.

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:08.110
But meanwhile, emotions, love, insults, we can't talk about that right now.

00:26:08.380 --> 00:26:10.500
What if I become a celebrity?

00:26:10.860 --> 00:26:13.550
It's so difficult in this situation.

00:26:13.750 --> 00:26:17.880
But anyway, if the time came, we'd talk again, Nicola.

00:26:18.350 --> 00:26:20.950
Now I'm capable of everything. I want to talk to your aunt.

00:26:21.150 --> 00:26:24.910
Nicola, please, but if I haven't told her, Nicola...

00:26:25.950 --> 00:26:27.550
- Go to sleep. - Please, Nicola.

00:26:27.750 --> 00:26:28.680
Go to sleep.

00:26:40.680 --> 00:26:47.920
- Who is he? - Just a moment!

00:26:47.920 --> 00:26:52.060
I came to see the representatives.

00:26:52.060 --> 00:26:57.510
Why did I leave my father, who was with my father, and I came here to serve him?

00:26:57.510 --> 00:26:58.870
So that I could be loved by him.

00:27:00.600 --> 00:27:02.410
- What do you want? - To talk.

00:27:02.580 --> 00:27:04.020
I have to talk to you right now.

00:27:04.220 --> 00:27:05.420
At 11 o'clock at night?

00:27:05.520 --> 00:27:07.220
I'm not saying it's so important!

00:27:07.320 --> 00:27:08.920
For me, it's more important than life.

00:27:09.160 --> 00:27:12.870
I just spoke to Stella and she promised to marry me when she gets to Triunfo.

00:27:13.540 --> 00:27:16.070
I just need to get a job tomorrow.

00:27:16.160 --> 00:27:17.660
And where are you going in such a hurry?

00:27:17.760 --> 00:27:18.560
We'll talk tomorrow.

00:27:18.660 --> 00:27:21.460
No, right now, like any orchestra musician.

00:27:21.560 --> 00:27:23.160
I studied music in Italy.

00:27:23.310 --> 00:27:25.910
I don't want to be a star, I want to start from the bottom.

00:27:26.010 --> 00:27:28.100
I'll take care of that, until tomorrow. Go!

00:27:28.550 --> 00:27:29.890
Now he's serious.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:32.590
- I'm playing hard to get. - I work if I don't.

00:27:33.590 --> 00:27:36.950
You're a barbarian. Besides, this isn't the time for work.

00:27:37.100 --> 00:27:39.830
I'm dedicated to rest, as Ferrini told me on board.

00:27:40.720 --> 00:27:43.380
- Ferrini, the millionaire! - The man on the boat!

00:27:43.560 --> 00:27:47.200
- Tomorrow morning we'll go to your office! - Yes, let's go, Nicola!

00:27:47.240 --> 00:27:50.380
- Tomorrow, go to Ferrini's office! - Let's go, Nicola, let's go!

00:27:50.900 --> 00:27:52.800
- What's going on? - They're running away!

00:27:52.840 --> 00:27:58.130
- They're running away! - They're running away!

00:28:01.050 --> 00:28:06.310
We have triumphed, we are rich, we are millionaires!

00:28:06.330 --> 00:28:07.330
Long live Bellini!

00:28:07.350 --> 00:28:09.820
- Long live Bellini! - My house is full of drunks!

00:28:09.890 --> 00:28:11.750
Smile, brother, smile.

00:28:11.760 --> 00:28:13.350
Good evening, ma'am.

00:28:13.370 --> 00:28:15.170
I can't, I can't.

00:28:15.190 --> 00:28:17.870
She buys me with that witch smile.

00:28:17.890 --> 00:28:18.890
Help me.

00:28:21.030 --> 00:28:23.170
Take a bath in the morning, old man. We'll see Bellini.

00:28:23.190 --> 00:28:25.810
Kilos of gold, pounds of gold, like that.

00:28:25.830 --> 00:28:29.090
Long live Bellini!

00:28:42.250 --> 00:28:45.250
The company, Sociedad Anónima "La Criolla".

00:28:45.250 --> 00:28:48.210
See? Here it is. Inside the Icona. Let's go.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:02.690
- Mr. Zarrini, please. - Do you have an appointment with him?

00:29:02.690 --> 00:29:05.550
No, but the truth is that we are very good friends.

00:29:05.550 --> 00:29:07.550
Ask the legal advisor there.

00:29:07.550 --> 00:29:09.550
The legal advisor solves everything here.

00:29:09.550 --> 00:29:11.550
He sends more than the boss.

00:29:11.550 --> 00:29:13.430
Come on, don't waste time. The legal advisor.

00:29:13.430 --> 00:29:17.390
Here is the potato.

00:29:17.390 --> 00:29:28.480
Come in, gentlemen.

00:29:28.480 --> 00:29:30.000
We would like to see Mr. Zarrini.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:32.060
- Mr. Ferrini. - Did you invite them?

00:29:32.060 --> 00:29:36.180
Yes, miss, Nicanor Gorostiaga, Nicola Paone.

00:29:36.180 --> 00:29:40.430
Come in, the legal advisor will tell you if you can see them.

00:29:40.430 --> 00:29:43.890
But what are you going to say about this legal advice? What do you care? Let's get in.

00:29:49.950 --> 00:29:55.670
My God, brother, here you're going to have to smile loudly because we're going to miss it. Come on, smile.

00:30:01.690 --> 00:30:04.730
- How are you, my dear friend? - What do you have here?

00:30:05.160 --> 00:30:07.170
- Who are you? - Give me the potato.

00:30:07.400 --> 00:30:09.890
This is the kind of periscope I gave to the immigrant.

00:30:10.010 --> 00:30:12.180
Answer me. Who are you?

00:30:12.400 --> 00:30:14.940
I don't know if you remember that we became very friends

00:30:14.960 --> 00:30:18.160
three months ago at a party on board when we came back from Europe.

00:30:18.300 --> 00:30:20.500
Oh, I remember.

00:30:20.780 --> 00:30:23.140
You are those rascals from "Tercera".

00:30:23.320 --> 00:30:25.220
- Let's go, Correstiega. - Allow me, sir.

00:30:25.550 --> 00:30:27.750
Let's talk about the artistic business with Mr. Ferrín.

00:30:27.780 --> 00:30:30.000
You are going to talk to the police, if you don't leave immediately.

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:32.950
Perfect, ma'am, call a vigilante right away.

00:30:32.950 --> 00:30:33.950
Let's go, Chimitín is in jail.

00:30:33.950 --> 00:30:35.780
Don't worry, old man, look at my cold blood.

00:30:35.780 --> 00:30:37.780
Perfect, you're missing it, sir.

00:30:37.780 --> 00:30:39.780
I'll ask Mr. Zarrín for account.

00:30:39.780 --> 00:30:40.780
Get out of here, I said.

00:30:40.780 --> 00:30:42.780
- Come on. - Push, sir, push.

00:30:42.780 --> 00:30:45.210
- Don't push. - Scoundrel.

00:30:45.210 --> 00:30:48.750
Why did you lie to me? Maybe that costs me the job.

00:30:48.750 --> 00:30:50.680
I'm sorry, ma'am, but that man is...

00:30:50.680 --> 00:30:53.210
Smile a little, smile.

00:30:53.210 --> 00:30:56.210
More than smiling, I smiled at the face that made me come to hell, let's go.

00:31:00.280 --> 00:31:04.450
- Hello, what are you doing here? - Who is this guy?

00:31:04.450 --> 00:31:09.350
- Where do you know him from? - From abroad, I'm Mr. Ferrini's assistant.

00:31:09.350 --> 00:31:11.430
Ah, the one who told us he'd give us a hand!

00:31:11.430 --> 00:31:16.140
Well, we came to see your boss, to see if we can locate this phenomenon in his radio vision.

00:31:16.140 --> 00:31:18.020
You won't see him here.

00:31:18.020 --> 00:31:21.580
Besides, this moron is in charge of advertising, and he's going to kick them to death.

00:31:21.580 --> 00:31:24.230
Then there's no way to talk to this Mr. Ferrini.

00:31:24.230 --> 00:31:27.350
What is he, a knight, a prince, a marquis, emperor, what is he?

00:31:27.350 --> 00:31:30.000
He's an old millionaire who gives everything in the hands of others.

00:31:30.060 --> 00:31:32.180
However, I got the feeling that he is a good man.

00:31:32.180 --> 00:31:34.320
Besides, he liked the song of Nicola.

00:31:34.320 --> 00:31:37.390
Look, there is only one person who has more ...

00:31:37.390 --> 00:31:41.470
... than Dr. Bellagamba, his daughter, Mrs. Elvira.

00:31:41.470 --> 00:31:43.030
She also congratulated me.

00:31:43.030 --> 00:31:45.470
If you convince her to talk to the Father, maybe ...

00:31:45.470 --> 00:31:47.150
- Where does she live? - Here.

00:31:47.150 --> 00:31:50.410
If they hurry to fish before lunch, when the Father arrives ...

00:31:50.410 --> 00:31:53.540
In Olivos, it's like 80 blocks.

00:31:53.540 --> 00:31:55.840
- How is the wheel? - What did you say?

00:31:55.840 --> 00:31:58.470
Of the tires, of the feet.

00:31:58.470 --> 00:32:00.000
They are a post-Gonfie.

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:02.000
- But it was a walk. - Let's go then.

00:32:02.000 --> 00:32:04.040
- Thank you very much. - Smile.

00:32:04.040 --> 00:32:07.120
- Greetings. - Good luck.

00:32:07.120 --> 00:32:08.200
Goodbye.

00:32:08.200 --> 00:32:13.660
But listen, if we have to walk a lot, we need to eat something.

00:32:13.660 --> 00:32:15.660
You know, we go out of the pension without breakfast.

00:32:15.660 --> 00:32:20.660
But of course! Before seeing that lady, we go through a restaurant and eat actively.

00:32:20.660 --> 00:32:22.660
Habente pensadiente.

00:32:23.660 --> 00:32:30.000
We are morphing the return of the trolleybus.

00:32:43.630 --> 00:32:46.200
One o'clock and lunch is soon. I have to wait for Dad.

00:32:46.760 --> 00:32:49.220
It turns out that my alleged boyfriend, Dr. Benagamba,

00:32:49.460 --> 00:32:51.140
has thought of inviting himself to lunch.

00:32:54.100 --> 00:32:57.060
Are these olives, or are we arriving in Antarctica?

00:32:57.320 --> 00:32:58.220
This is the house.

00:32:59.210 --> 00:33:00.000
Alfa...

00:33:00.030 --> 00:33:02.110
Finally, I couldn't take it any longer.

00:33:02.190 --> 00:33:04.330
I'm glad you have that old man in your shoes...

